# Methods {#sec-methods}

The approach in one display equation:

$$ D_{\mathrm{KL}}(P\,\|\,Q) = \sum_k p_k \log\frac{p_k}{q_k} $$

::: {.theorem #thm-kl}
The KL divergence is non-negative, with equality iff $P = Q$.
:::

By @thm-kl, the objective is bounded below.

